   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85306-88.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0093_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>MKḆLWNty mlṭwy[
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>symʾhkˈ MN BYRḤ[ ṭyl
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>Y ŠNṬ $$-III-III-III ......[
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>prʾc mṭrykʾn lʾd MN mʾhp̄ylwcˈ
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>NKSYʾ $-X ẔWẔN ○ W pṭglʾḇ
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>mlṭwy PWN gwkʾdymwdlyhʾ Y dʾṭplhwˈ
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>Y dʾṭwḏʾn ḤṬYMWNṭ ○○
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0093_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>padīrēd Mardōy[
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>sēmāhag az māh[ Tīr
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>ī sāl 49 ......[
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>frāz Mihrīgān rāy az Māhpērōz
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>xwāstag 30 drahm ○ ud padīrāy
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>Mardōy pad gugāy-muhrīhā ī Dādfarrox
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>ī Dādōyān āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0093_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Mardōy receives[   
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>for the period of three months from month [Tīr (4th month)]
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>of the year 49 (700/1 CE) ...... [ 
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>until Mihrīgān from Māhpērōz 
               <lb n="5-7" xml:id="trans-p1-l5-7"/>money: 30 dirham. And Mardōy sealed the receipt with the witness’ seals of Dādfarrox, (son) of Dādōy.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>